    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろん！　絶好調だよ！\r\nはやくステージに立ちたいな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり、昨日友達と遊んだおかげか？\r\n久々の息抜きだったからな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ、おかげで今日のライブも\r\n全力で頑張れそう！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あとね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっとね\r\nその……えへへ。ありがとうね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、どうしたんだ急に",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、プロデューサーがスケジュールを\r\n調整してくれるおかげで、みんなと遊んでこれたんだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うまく休みを合わせたり、疲れが溜まらないように\r\n仕事の順番を変えたりしてくれて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……本当にありがとう\r\nここまで来れたのも、プロデューサーのおかげだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nめぐるが喜んでくれてるなら何よりだよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ。それとね、あと一個報告！\r\n実は昨日、みんなと遊んだ時にね、嬉しいことがあったの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしね、昨日みんなに謝ってきたんだ。最近遊んだり、\r\n助っ人で参加する日が減ってごめんね、って",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……もしかしたら嫌われちゃうかもって\r\n心配だったんだけど、全然、そんなことなくって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "むしろ、わたしのアイドルとしての活動を\r\n応援するって言ってくれたんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "「いままで助けてくれた分、めぐるのライブの時には\r\n私たちが応援に行くから」って……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日のライブにだって、来てくれてるんだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。それでそんなに張り切ってたんだな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　だって、友達のためにアイドルを頑張れるなんて\r\nこんな最高なこと他にないもん！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……プロデューサーが力を貸してくれたから、\r\nわたし、今日みたいに最高の舞台に立てるんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "応援してくれるみんなのためにも、\r\nもっともっと頑張るからっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "行けるとこまで\r\n進もう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "今以上にアイドルの\r\n仕事を頑張らなくちゃな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "これからは\r\nもっと大変になるぞ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、プロデューサーがいてくれるから、\r\nどこまででも進めるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それに、さっきは友達のために\r\n頑張るって言ったけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーのためでもあるからね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "アイドルも友達も、全力で付き合うって決めたから\r\nこれからもよろしく、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あっ、そろそろ本番だ\r\nそれじゃ、行ってくるね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050210"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まわりの人がいるからこそ、めぐるはより一層\r\n輝くんだろうな……）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（俺も、めぐるがもっと輝けるように協力をしていこう！）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "半端なことをしたら、友達にかまけて\r\nアイドル活動をおろそかにしたと思われる",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるがそんなことを言われてたら、\r\n友達だって悲しむぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……もちろん、分かってる！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "友達のみんなや……２８３のみんな……\r\nそれにプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "みんなのためにも、わたし、もっともっと輝くから！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その意気だ\r\n……よし、それじゃあそろそろ本番だぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001050250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、行ってくるね、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300105/1003001050250"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
